  "_arrowArmourEffectiveness": "arrowheads pierce: armour is only this effective against an arrow (the AP profiles in combat/ballistics.ts, simplified)",
  "_armourScaleNote": "Armour gets its own material ladder, separate from the weapon damage ladder and much steeper - Morrowind's is 8x from iron to daedric. Steel is 1.0 so the reference set still rates 50. This is what lets 'typical endgame armour = 3 unavoided blows, absolute best = 5-6' (owner ruling, round 2) exist at all: with the weapon ladder reused for armour the whole endgame sat within 1.4x.",
